WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.749
"Mom!" Harry said.

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:06.914
"Sanjay's birthday party is at Fun Zone!

3
00:00:06.915 --> 00:00:09.110
Can I go?"

4
00:00:09.111 --> 00:00:12.691
"Sure," Mom said.

5
00:00:12.692 --> 00:00:16.473
Harry thought about his own birthday party.

6
00:00:16.474 --> 00:00:19.424
He was having it in the backyard.

7
00:00:19.425 --> 00:00:22.475
Harry sighed.

8
00:00:22.476 --> 00:00:27.102
"I wish my party was at Fun Zone."

9
00:00:27.103 --> 00:00:30.865
"Fun Zone is expensive," Mom said.

10
00:00:30.866 --> 00:00:33.698
"You'll have a fun party here."

11
00:00:33.699 --> 00:00:36.853
Harry shrugged.

12
00:00:36.854 --> 00:00:40.834
Mom drove Harry to Sanjay's party.

13
00:00:40.835 --> 00:00:43.871
Fun Zone looked awesome.

14
00:00:43.872 --> 00:00:47.636
"This will be great," Harry said.

15
00:00:47.637 --> 00:00:52.015
"Let's play laser tag!" Sanjay said.

16
00:00:52.016 --> 00:00:55.420
Everyone put on vests.

17
00:00:55.421 --> 00:00:58.799
They grabbed plastic laser guns.

18
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:01.639
Then they entered a dark room.

19
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:05.248
Harry shot a laser at Finn.

20
00:01:05.249 --> 00:01:08.858
Finn's vest didn't beep.

21
00:01:08.859 --> 00:01:12.111
Sanjay shot at Harry.

22
00:01:12.112 --> 00:01:19.726
"My laser gun doesn't work!" Sanjay said.

23
00:01:19.727 --> 00:01:25.604
"Mine doesn't work either!" Jackson said.

24
00:01:25.605 --> 00:01:28.339
"Huh," a worker said.

25
00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:31.100
"The equipment is broken."

26
00:01:31.101 --> 00:01:35.981
"That stinks," Sanjay said.

27
00:01:35.982 --> 00:01:41.343
The friends went into the arcade.

28
00:01:41.344 --> 00:01:45.136
"They have Dino Hunter!" Harry said.

29
00:01:45.137 --> 00:01:47.723
Everyone hurried to the game.

30
00:01:47.724 --> 00:01:51.017
A sign was stuck to the machine.

31
00:01:51.018 --> 00:01:54.062
It read Out of Order.

32
00:01:54.063 --> 00:01:58.917
Sanjay groaned.

33
00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:04.791
"Let's play Skee-Ball," Finn said.

34
00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:08.455
Sanjay rolled a ball.

35
00:02:08.456 --> 00:02:13.709
"One hundred points!" Jackson said.

36
00:02:13.710 --> 00:02:16.283
The game buzzed.

37
00:02:16.284 --> 00:02:19.161
The tickets got jammed.

38
00:02:19.162 --> 00:02:23.855
Sanjay frowned.

39
00:02:23.856 --> 00:02:26.991
Later Mom picked up Harry.

40
00:02:26.992 --> 00:02:31.544
"How was the party?" she asked.

41
00:02:31.545 --> 00:02:35.581
"It was okay." Harry smiled.

42
00:02:35.582 --> 00:02:42.904
"My backyard party will be more fun!"

